    "steam_appid": 2654590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654590/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1706302963\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Scrap and Battery stars a little robot working in a factory since the day he was made. Tired of working, he decides to take matters into his own hands and attempts to escape! Help him navigate through the large facility and reach the bottom of the facility. Utilize various abilities to build your playstyle and bring havoc to the facility! However, your limited battery is your enemy. Will you make it to the end? Or become scraps while trying?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654590/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1706302963\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Express how you want to play by building your load out of your abilities!<br></li><li>Upgrade and improve your abilities with scraps picked up through levels!<br></li><li>Navigate through 7 levels and confront various types of enemies within. Absorb their energy by defeating them. <br></li><li>Hold onto your battery to stay powered! Enemies will try to knock it off by any means necessary!<br></li><li>Attempt multiple runs to test your best builds and break your records!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654590/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1706302963\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654590/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1706302963\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Scrap and Battery stars a little robot working in a factory since the day he was made. Tired of working, he decides to take matters into his own hands and attempts to escape! Help him navigate through the large facility and reach the bottom of the facility. Utilize various abilities to build your playstyle and bring havoc to the facility! However, your limited battery is your enemy. Will you make it to the end? Or become scraps while trying?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654590/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1706302963\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Express how you want to play by building your load out of your abilities!<br></li><li>Upgrade and improve your abilities with scraps picked up through levels!<br></li><li>Navigate through 7 levels and confront various types of enemies within. Absorb their energy by defeating them. <br></li><li>Hold onto your battery to stay powered! Enemies will try to knock it off by any means necessary!<br></li><li>Attempt multiple runs to test your best builds and break your records!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654590/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1706302963\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
